.git
.idea
.vscode
# Without this, stale local Maven build output (e.g. a renamed/deleted migration file that
# `mvn compile` without `clean` never removes from target/classes) gets copied into every Java
# service's Docker build context and merged into the fresh in-container build -- this is exactly
# what caused llm-gateway's "Found more than one migration with version 45" crash-loop: two V45
# files, one stale from a local rebuild, one from the real renamed source.
**/target
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
ai-service/.env
ai-service/tests
ai-service/work
